{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413140","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041314001:1":{"text":"아든 현자님, 점성술의 원리가 궁금해요!","source_cn":"雅顿贤者，占卜的原理到底是什么呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59877FB5AD7296FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041314002:1":{"text":"점성술은 미래에 대한 결과를 알려주는 것이 아니라 힌트를 주는 거란다.","source_cn":"占卜给予我们的是对于未来的启示，而非结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F02277C3D40B02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041314003:1":{"text":"점성술은 이미 알고 있는 조건을 이용해 특수한 힘으로 운명의 강을 엿봄으로써 미지의 문제에 대한 가장 큰 가능성을 찾는 거지.","source_cn":"占卜，就是利用已知条件，通过特殊的力量窥视命运长河，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7494C18B19F819F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041314004:1":{"text":"아... 수학 같은 거라서 치피가 못하는 거였네요!","source_cn":"啊……原来占卜是数学问题，怪不得满满学不会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x247C06C939FA4E93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雅顿":{"text":"아든","source":"雅顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}